nt-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- ~3.5TB for RDS environment (not backed up)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- ~270 vCPU / ~740 GB RAM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- Office 365 backup service in place, JA Russell open to other options&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;* Linux Environment&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- Pronto Production: 24 vCPU / 96 GB RAM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- 3x Test VMs spun up on-demand&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;- Storage? (17 TB of bakup storage in Plan B, but that’s for DR snapshots)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Combining both environments, the totals are:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;br/&gt; &lt;br/&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;margin-left:6;margin-right:0;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-indent:0;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0;list-style-type: disc&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Roughly 300 vCPU&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Roughly 850 GB RAM&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;At least 48.5TB total storage (including Plan B backup space) &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plus additional expansion room for new hosts (e.g. temporary &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:center;margin-left:6;margin-right:0;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-indent:0;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0;list-style-type: disc&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;databases) or hosts&lt;/font&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:14.11px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt; &lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:left;margin-left:6;margin-right:0;margin-top:0px;margin-bottom:0px;text-indent:0;vertical-align:middle;direction:ltr;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;margin: 0;list-style-type: disc&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:12.7px;font-family:Arial;color:#000000;direction:ltr;letter-spacing:0px;line-height:100%;opacity:1&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;Support as they’d be using our PaaS.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" vertex="1">
